   "k": "1fzffzm",
   "en": "It's also possible to end Sino-Japanese war before 1941 by using volunteers. If Guanxi clique is at peace with Japan, it's unable to take *Demand Tonkinese Bases* focus, therefore Pearl Harbor never happens and USA doesn't join Allies, which will make further war with Allies easier. Japan will sign white peace with China if China controls all core states, Manchuria is capitulated and Korea isn't controlled by Japan."
