   "k": "149kklk",
   "en": "To do this, support Guomintang and send 3 light tank, 3 mountaineer, a wing of fighters and a wing of tactical bombers early. Japanese divisions shouldn't be able to pierce even the basic Soviet light tank template. Prioritize clearing plains, landings, then supply hubs. Once Manchuria is reached, try to rush Mukden - it can be particularly difficult to take once China eats all the supply on that front."
